plan_1:
- Test lower prices below 12.5 to attract more customers and increase sales volume;
    - Monitor the impact of competitor pricing on our own sales, adjusting accordingly;
    - Develop marketing strategies to highlight price differences and product value propositions compared to competitors at lower prices.

insight_1:
- Lower prices are likely to result in higher sales volumes;
    - Pricing sensitivity is evident among customers as higher prices lead to fewer quantities sold;
    - Maintaining a price around 12.5 or lower appears profitable, though further optimization may be possible with careful pricing and marketing strategies.
